    </category>
    <overview>
      <Value><![CDATA[Heart failure affects an estimated 146,000 Australian adults and is recorded in many hospitalisations and deaths. This page summarises national data on how many people are living with heart failure, how often it leads to hospital care, and its role in deaths. Hospitalisation and death figures include both heart failure and cardiomyopathy]]></Value>
    </overview>
